efficiency:
    one substitution of step is a unit of time
    constant time: the different inputs wont affect the time of 
                   function

    worst case efficiency: we usually care about the maximum time 
                    the computation needs

    if the worst case time can be expressed as a linear function of need
    we say the function is linear time

built-in function:
    length - return the length of list

    efficiency: constant time 1

quadratic time:
    if the worst-case time function needs can be expressed as a quadratic function
    of n like f(n) = an^2 + bn + c, so we say it is a quadratic time function

